cff-version: 1.0.0
title: "OpenTech | DB"
message: "OPENTECH | DB is a domain-specific data repository and REST API that stores, manages, and distributes standardised technical and economic parameters for energy system technologies. It acts as a single source of truth for energy modelling workflows at the Deggendorf Institute of Technology (DIT) and partner institutions. "
